OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening with light winds, variable
OL,7,Fcloud and clear spells. Mist and fog
OL,8,Fpatches are likely to develop in any
OL,9,Fprolonged clear periods. Chilly, but
OL,10,Ftemperatures around average for the
OL,11,Ftime of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FSome patchy mist and fog to
OL,14,Fstart, soon clearing to leave a fine
OL,15,Fday with plenty of sunny spells and
OL,16,Flight winds. Patchy rain will then
OL,17,Farrive overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
